      "file_path": "TODO.md",
      "height": 80,
      "id": "4f41850aefda51c0",
      "line_num": 873,
      "source": "todo_md",
      "tags": [
        "#frontend",
        "#brand"
      ],
      "text": "**Share cards beyond try.sage \u2014 and the branding problem they run into (Alexander, 2026-08-03): any default card outside try.sage must be the operator's, not ours ([dossier](docs/board-dossiers.md)).**\n- [ ] Only `pages/templates/try-sage.html` carries a social card (gated on `WEBUI_URL`, Sage.is-branded 1200\u00d7630 JPEG)\n- [ ] The SPA shell `app/src/app.html` stays unbranded by decision (`try-sage-welcome.cy.ts` asserts it)\n- [ ] Decide first which surfaces are shareable at all \u2014 a pasted `/admin/diagnostics` or `/workshop/agents` link resolves to a login, so a card there advertises the instance's existence\n- [ ] Weigh (a): operator-supplied `og_image_url` in the branding panel beside the existing seven, zero generation\n- [ ] Weigh (b): request-time generation from `title`, `subtitle`, `logo_url`, `primary_color`/`accent_color` \u2014 the composition `tools/og-card/card.html` does by hand\n- [ ] Weigh (c): neutral unbranded default, overridden by (a)\n- [ ] Prerequisite: tags stay absent, never half-emitted, when unconfigured \u2014 the try.sage guard-rail invariant\n\n`#frontend` `#brand`\n`TODO.md:L873`",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 280,
      "x": 10,
      "y": 240
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 882,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "Do it after the no-build migration settles, so it pins against a stable surface"
        },
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 883,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "(1) Unversioned URL \u2014 SPOF by construction; a `startr.style/style.css` 5xx renders every consumer naked"
        },
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 884,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "(2) No SRI"
        },
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 885,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "(3) An air-gapped Rootstock gets unstyled chrome permanently \u2014 zero-egress is a case we sell \u2014 and the load is the one off-machine reach on an ordinary page load, telling startr.style someone opened an admin page"
        },
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 886,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "(4) The agents row menu overlays via `--pos:absolute`; with the framework blocked it falls into flow and shoves its neighbours \u2014 the bug positioning fixed, reappearing offline"
        },
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 887,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "Reason (4) is new in kind \u2014 BEHAVIOUR now depends on the CDN, not just appearance"
        }
      ],
      "file_path": "TODO.md",
      "height": 80,
      "id": "3b988b8b505f972e",
      "line_num": 881,
      "source": "todo_md",
      "tags": [
        "#frontend",
        "#perf",
        "#startr-style"
      ],
      "text": "**Version and vendor startr.style \u2014 the reasons keep accumulating (Alexander, 2026-08-01): vendoring a pinned copy answers all four reasons at once and deletes the egress line from `shell.py` ([dossier](docs/board-dossiers.md)).**\n- [ ] Do it after the no-build migration settles, so it pins against a stable surface\n- [ ] (1) Unversioned URL \u2014 SPOF by construction; a `startr.style/style.css` 5xx renders every consumer naked\n- [ ] (2) No SRI\n- [ ] (3) An air-gapped Rootstock gets unstyled chrome permanently \u2014 zero-egress is a case we sell \u2014 and the load is the one off-machine reach on an ordinary page load, telling startr.style someone opened an admin page\n- [ ] (4) The agents row menu overlays via `--pos:absolute`; with the framework blocked it falls into flow and shoves its neighbours \u2014 the bug positioning fixed, reappearing offline\n- [ ] Reason (4) is new in kind \u2014 BEHAVIOUR now depends on the CDN, not just appearance\n\n`#frontend` `#perf` `#startr-style`\n`TODO.md:L881`",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 280,
      "x": 10,
      "y": 330
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 889,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "`.grid` takes column counts \u2014 `--col-xs` (440px), `--col-sm` (640), `--col-md` (768), `--col-lg` (1024) \u2014 with no `--col` base and no `--col-xl`"
        },
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 890,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "The prop system's `--gtc` has base/`-sm`/`-md`/`-lg`/`-xl` but no `-xs`, so a layout wanting both a 440px tier and a 1280px tier must mix the two systems"
        },
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 891,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "Upstream fix: a handful of lines in `src/static/style.css`; one fix serves every consumer \u2014 real gap, not a blocker (the agents list went flex-wrap at zero cost)"
        },
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 892,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "Document the 440px `-xs` tier in the `/startr-style` skill prop tables \u2014 they list only `-sm`/`-md`/`-lg`/`-xl`/`-pt`"
        }
      ],
      "file_path": "TODO.md",
      "height": 80,
      "id": "b62dde039cbd4565",
      "line_num": 888,
      "source": "todo_md",
      "tags": [
        "#startr-style",
        "#docs"
      ],
      "text": "**startr.style grid breakpoint gap: neither grid system spans the full breakpoint ladder (found 2026-08-01; Alexander: backlog it, do not patch the framework yet). ([dossier](docs/board-dossiers.md))**\n- [ ] `.grid` takes column counts \u2014 `--col-xs` (440px), `--col-sm` (640), `--col-md` (768), `--col-lg` (1024) \u2014 with no `--col` base and no `--col-xl`\n- [ ] The prop system's `--gtc` has base/`-sm`/`-md`/`-lg`/`-xl` but no `-xs`, so a layout wanting both a 440px tier and a 1280px tier must mix the two systems\n- [ ] Upstream fix: a handful of lines in `src/static/style.css`; one fix serves every consumer \u2014 real gap, not a blocker (the agents list went flex-wrap at zero cost)\n- [ ] Document the 440px `-xs` tier in the `/startr-style` skill prop tables \u2014 they list only `-sm`/`-md`/`-lg`/`-xl`/`-pt`\n\n`#startr-style` `#docs`\n`TODO.md:L888`",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 280,
      "x": 10,
      "y": 420
    },
    {
      "children": [
