          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 895,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "macOS: Apple Developer ID + **notarization** (+ stapling) of the `.app`/`.dmg`/`.pkg`"
        },
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 896,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "Windows: **Authenticode** (ideally EV) to clear SmartScreen"
        },
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 897,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "Relates to the `ai-ui` brew formula + Developer-Mode onboarding; prior art to mine is Osmantic ODS (item below)"
        }
      ],
      "file_path": "TODO.md",
