      "line_num": 100,
      "source": "todo_md",
      "tags": [],
      "text": "**Diagnose the unresponsive Space Agent via `/admin/diagnostics`. Actionable as of 2026-08-03 \u2014 the diagnostics page (2.3.3) and how-to-fix modals (2.3.4) are now live on try.sage.is.**\n`TODO.md:L100`",
