      "line_num": 101,
      "source": "todo_md",
      "tags": [],
      "text": "**Decide the trial model set and who pays for the tokens. Undecided as of 2026-07-30 and it gates the instance provisioning below. Note the hidden Groq connection on try.sage.is is uncapped per user, and three people will share this workspace.**\n`TODO.md:L101`",
