      "line_num": 102,
      "source": "todo_md",
      "tags": [],
      "text": "**Day-in-the-life walkthrough \u2014 staged and labelled as staged: the proactive beats are outbound-on-a-schedule and there is no job scheduler \u2014 do not let \"does it do that by itself?\" get a soft answer.**\n- [ ] Trigger the beats (weather, stretches, reminders) by hand.\n- [ ] Say out loud that they are staged, and show the queue on the roadmap.\n\n`TODO.md:L102`",
