      "y": 960
    },
    {
      "file_path": "TODO.md",
      "height": 80,
      "id": "b3de4dec50419fa0",
      "line_num": 111,
      "source": "todo_md",
      "tags": [],
      "text": "**Assess whether documented SOPs exist; if not, introduce TodoScope as the lightweight starting point. This is the input to everything above.**\n`TODO.md:L111`",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 280,
      "x": 360,
      "y": 1050
    },
    {
      "file_path": "TODO.md",
      "height": 80,
      "id": "ffde9e20f738ebf4",
      "line_num": 112,
      "source": "todo_md",
      "tags": [],
      "text": "**Map the real system landscape: a CRM, the regional MLS, Google Sheets, Airtable, and a great deal of phone/WhatsApp/memory. There is no single system of record, which means the first build is probably capture rather than integration. MLS access is typically licence-restricted \u2014 establish early whether we may touch it at all.**\n`TODO.md:L112`",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 280,
      "x": 360,
      "y": 1140
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 115,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "Decide (a) whether Spaces already covers the internal case and makes the bridge unnecessary."
        },
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 116,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "Decide (b) whether it is client-facing."
        },
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 117,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "If client-facing on his business number: WAHA is unofficial and carries ban risk on the number his livelihood runs through \u2014 that risk conversation happens **before** we provision."
        },
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 118,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "If we do proceed: provision a WAHA sidecar container, a phone number, and a public HTTPS webhook."
        }
      ],
      "file_path": "TODO.md",
      "height": 80,
      "id": "d00e06eb07295b0a",
      "line_num": 113,
      "source": "todo_md",
      "tags": [],
      "text": "**Settle the WhatsApp question: currently mis-framed as \"explore\" \u2014 the bridge already shipped in 2.0.0, so there is nothing to evaluate.**\n- [ ] Decide (a) whether Spaces already covers the internal case and makes the bridge unnecessary.\n- [ ] Decide (b) whether it is client-facing.\n- [ ] If client-facing on his business number: WAHA is unofficial and carries ban risk on the number his livelihood runs through \u2014 that risk conversation happens **before** we provision.\n- [ ] If we do proceed: provision a WAHA sidecar container, a phone number, and a public HTTPS webhook.\n\n`TODO.md:L113`",
