      "height": 80,
      "id": "02794865eac8a375",
      "line_num": 120,
      "source": "todo_md",
      "tags": [],
      "text": "**Establish the brokerage's position on email. Their shared admin and tech staff own it. Any mail-side integration needs their cooperation and may simply be refused \u2014 better to know before it is designed in.**\n`TODO.md:L120`",
