      "height": 80,
      "id": "dbaf13d371f142c5",
      "line_num": 139,
      "source": "todo_md",
      "tags": [],
      "text": "**1. Spaces multi-user \u2014 three people (principal, assistant, VA) share one workspace from day one, and the customer's primary success metric is unreachable without it. Highest value, do first. Now under `## In Progress` \u2192 _Spaces Enhancements_; mechanics e2e-verified 2026-08-18, remaining work is agent context modes + productization.**\n`TODO.md:L139`",
      "type": "text",
