      "height": 80,
      "id": "86e06abde7a9445c",
      "line_num": 140,
      "source": "todo_md",
      "tags": [],
      "text": "**2. Spend budgets per user AND per API key \u2014 required before a customer instance goes live with hosted models and three sharers. See the backlog item; the try.sage uncapped-Groq note there is now a live commercial exposure, not a hypothetical.**\n`TODO.md:L140`",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 280,
      "x": 360,
      "y": 1770
    },
    {
      "file_path": "TODO.md",
      "height": 80,
      "id": "6482adeecd4ec223",
      "line_num": 141,
      "source": "todo_md",
      "tags": [],
      "text": "**3. Sprig catalog de-hardcoding (marketplace M1) \u2014 prerequisite for shipping the tooling as autoconfig Sprigs, and therefore for the segment story rather than just this customer. The blocker is the hardcoded Python `CATALOG` in `supervisor.py`.**\n`TODO.md:L141`",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 280,
      "x": 360,
      "y": 1860
    },
    {
      "file_path": "TODO.md",
      "height": 80,
      "id": "a0411dd04b43f6b9",
      "line_num": 142,
      "source": "todo_md",
      "tags": [],
      "text": "**4. Job queue \u2014 last on purpose. The demo is staged-and-labelled and November needs no software, so nothing forces real proactive nudges until the configs and features have landed. Promote it when a staged beat has to become a real one.**\n`TODO.md:L142`",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 280,
      "x": 360,
      "y": 1950
    },
    {
