        },
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 174,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "[WE] Build or drop the missing destination pages (`/prompts/create`, `/models/create`, `/functions/create`, `/chats/upload`, `/leaderboard`) \u2014 four of five soft-404, so Share toasts success and does nothing."
        },
