          "line_num": 293,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "_Multi-arch `bun install` contention FIXED 3.1.0 (2026-08-10) \u2014 `sharing=locked` BuildKit cache mount on bun's cache in `Dockerfile`; 940 tarballs, 21s solo vs 181s contended, second arch reads warm cache in 31s; `ensure_builder --use` fixed, cache wipe now opt-in via `CLEAN_BUILD=1`; reads as a network flake and is not one. Archived \u2192 docs/completed-todos.md._"
