          "text": "_One release door SHIPPED (2026-08-12) \u2014 `make ship` is the only public publish path, hotfixes included; internals `_`-prefixed with no `##`; deleted `scripts/release.sh`, `release:` + 5 dead targets; GHCR pair collapsed into `_release_and_push_GHCR`; `docs_gate` caught all 4 stale doc references. Archived \u2192 docs/completed-todos.md._"
