          "text": "_Pre-push hooks inert on tag pushes fixed (2026-08-12) \u2014 pre-commit skips every hook on a no-new-commit ref range (seen on the `v3.1.0` repair: 8 hooks Skipped, `tags_annotated` among them); `always_run: true` on `scan-tree` + `gauntlet-fast`, proved in sandbox on an empty range. Archived \u2192 docs/completed-todos.md._"
