          "text": "No hand-patching `~/Library/LaunchAgents/*.plist` \u2014 stock `cloudflared` proved the trap 2026-05-19."
        },
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 334,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "Its plist omits the subcommand from `ProgramArguments`, so it exits 1, KeepAlive retries forever, brew shows `error 1`."
        },
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 335,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "`brew upgrade` silently overwrites the hand-patched fix."
        },
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 336,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "Bake the plist template into `ai-ui.rb` / `ai-ui@1.rb`'s `service do` block"
        },
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 337,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "Full `ProgramArguments`: binary + `start` subcommand + the container-launch flags"
        },
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 338,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "`KeepAlive { SuccessfulExit=false }`, `RunAtLoad=true`"
        },
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 339,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "`StandardOutPath`/`StandardErrorPath` \u2192 `/opt/homebrew/var/log/ai-ui.{log,err.log}`"
        },
        {
