          "tags": [],
          "text": "`--system` flag (or a sibling `ai-ui-headless` formula) installs a LaunchDaemon under `/Library/LaunchDaemons/` for unattended-reboot uptime; document the tradeoff vs auto-login + LaunchAgent"
        },
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 341,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "`ai-ui start`/`stop`/`update` integrate with `launchctl` (or `brew services`): one command per side, idempotent across re-runs"
        },
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 342,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "Idempotent install/upgrade: `brew upgrade ai-ui` must not duplicate the plist, evict a running service, or leave an orphan plist after `brew uninstall`; `brew services list` always reflects reality"
        },
