          "tags": [],
          "text": "Sage-is = science+platform, Startr = tooling+product \u2014 the arms-length Graft Union\u2122 settles licensing"
        },
        {
          "checked": true,
          "line_num": 486,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "Done at the cheap moment: `agent-` capability prefix RESERVED in sprig-spec v1.md with a planned `sage-is/v1/agent` dispatch shape; CHANGELOG [Unreleased] entry added"
        },
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 487,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "Define the contract when the Sprig lands \u2014 run lifecycle, streamed events, cancellation, schema at `sprig-spec/schemas/sage-is/v1/agent.json`"
        },
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 488,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "Bidirectional from day one (locked 2026-07-11): a rootstock callback surface so agents work with the operator's data instead of shipping copies"
        },
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 489,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "Wire explicit rootstock dispatch \u2014 the \"no per-capability dispatch code\" guarantee covers only OpenAI-compatible shapes"
        },
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 490,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "Implement `delivery: service-endpoint` (currently unimplemented); both deliveries locked \u2014 hosted `service-endpoint` and on-hardware `oci-artifact`, keeping zero-egress intact"
        },
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 491,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "Keep one tiered \"Agents\" surface, no renames \u2014 the locked decisions define the EXTENDED tier (simple agents already ship as workspace Agents and Space agents)"
        },
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 492,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "The model-transparency claim extends to the remote tier"
        },
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 493,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "Job queue + spend budgets are PREREQUISITES: runs live on the queue, budgets gate spend"
        },
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 494,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "Ignore Scion's stale pointer paths: specs live in the BONSAI sibling repos, the graft API is `routers/sprigs.py`, pins live in the supervisor CATALOG"
        }
      ],
