          "tags": [],
          "text": "Opening Settings \u2192 Audio RELOADS Kokoro even after playback already loaded it \u2014 the Settings main-thread loader and the playback Web Worker (`kokoro.worker.ts`) are separate contexts; share one loader/model so the model loads once per session"
        },
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 605,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "Kokoro voice selector is janky (a type-in input + a list that only opens after you clear the field) \u2192 replace with a clean, DRY `<select>`/combobox"
        }
      ],
      "file_path": "TODO.md",
