          "text": "_e2e harness could silently run on the previous run's data (2026-07-29): `|| true` on `docker volume rm` hid a held volume \u2014 third instance of a gate whose failure is indistinguishable from success; fix waits for container removal, retries, hard-exits naming the holder; proved able to fire: `FATAL: volume 'sage-e2e-data' survived removal`. #e2e #critical. Archived \u2192 docs/completed-todos.md._"
