          "text": "Unblocked: panels moved to Jinja2; `shell.py` needs no templating, and `shell.asset_url()` already version-stamps by release"
        },
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 701,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "Measured on the shipped image: `cache-control: no-cache`, no ETag, no Last-Modified, `If-None-Match` returns 200 not 304, via the static `<link>` at `app.html:21`"
        },
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 702,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "Inject `?v=<active theme name + css mtime>` into the shell's `<link>` at serve time"
        },
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 703,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "Serve the CSS `immutable, max-age=31536000` \u2014 a graft changes the token, so pickup is instant with zero revalidation (SvelteKit's `_app/immutable` trick)"
        },
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 704,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "Trap: do NOT key invalidation to deploys \u2014 `SPRIG_ACTIVE_THEME` flips at RUNTIME (`routers/sprigs.py:151,305`), so deploy-keyed caching hides a fresh graft until restart"
        },
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 705,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "Rejected: short TTL (grafted theme one load late); ETag-only (saves the 23-byte body, not the round-trip)"
