          "line_num": 1089,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "Heaviest single item: `/api/models?` at 2,702 kB decoded \u2014 snapshot-driven, worth checking against the 08-02 figure first; the rest is `_app/immutable` chunks (top four: 764+606+543+411 kB)."
        },
