          "text": "Unreachable from the UI: `Chat.svelte:1716` gates on `$config?.features?.enable_web_search`, which the backend never emits."
        },
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 1187,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "Reachable from the API: `features` is popped off the request body unvalidated."
        },
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 1188,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "Delete the branch \u2014 do NOT wire it up. Decision confirmed 2026-08-06: search moved to OpenAPI tool servers (`TOOL_SERVER_CONNECTIONS` + `utils/try_sage_tool_servers.py`)."
        },
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 1189,
