      "source": "todo_md",
      "tags": [
        "#bug"
      ],
      "text": "**`data: [DONE]` does not terminate the stream loop: `stream_body_handler` has no case for the sentinel \u2014 it fails `json.loads` and is skipped by the `except` at [middleware.py:1926](app/backend/sage_is_ai/utils/middleware.py#L1926); a provider that appends anything after the sentinel gets it rendered.**\n- [ ] Content arriving AFTER `[DONE]` is still parsed, appended to the blocks, emitted to the reader and persisted.\n- [ ] Harmless with well-behaved providers, which stop sending.\n- [ ] Pinned in the `done-sentinel-and-noise` oracle golden, which ends with `\"Answer survives the noise. trailing after DONE\"`.\n- [ ] Found 2026-08-04 while reading the oracle goldens (chat-path chart); logged not fixed \u2014 behaviour frozen.\n\n`#bug`\n`TODO.md:L1208`",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 280,
