          "tags": [],
          "text": "Every model family has its own set (`<|eot_id|>`, `<|im_end|>`, `<\uff5cend\u2581of\u2581sentence\uff5c>`, `<|end_of_text|>`), so the fix belongs at one boundary rather than per-provider."
        },
        {
          "checked": false,
