      "file_path": "TODO.md",
      "height": 80,
      "id": "c15712f0712c42d5",
      "line_num": 1291,
      "source": "todo_md",
      "tags": [
        "#bug"
      ],
      "text": "**AI Engine Wizard Embedding Download Has No Stall Watchdog: when the embedding model fetch from HuggingFace stalls, the wizard sits in `embedding=downloading` indefinitely \u2014 a real user has no signal except an idle spinner.**\n- [ ] Stall causes: network drop, HF outage, slow link.\n- [ ] No timeout, no retry, no resumable state surfaced to the admin.\n- [ ] `wizard-smoke.sh` catches this externally via `INSTALL_TIMEOUT_SEC`.\n- [ ] Verified still unfixed 2026-08-03: no watchdog or `stalled` state in `routers/retrieval.py`.\n- [ ] Surface HF download progress (bytes, last-byte timestamp) to `request.app.state.MODEL_DOWNLOAD_STATUS` so the status endpoint exposes liveness.\n- [ ] Watchdog in `_download` (`retrieval.py`):\n- [ ] if cache size hasn't grown in N minutes (configurable, default 5), mark status=`stalled`, capture the error.\n- [ ] allow retry via a re-POST to `/api/v1/retrieval/models/download`.\n- [ ] Surface stalled state in the wizard UI with a retry button + \"check your connection\" hint.\n\n`#bug`\n`TODO.md:L1291`",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 280,
      "x": 1060,
      "y": 2670
    },
