      "id": "4e376dca76b3b00f",
      "line_num": 1319,
      "source": "todo_md",
      "tags": [
        "#bug"
      ],
      "text": "**Code fence in chat renders near invisible: typed or pasted text inside a code fence shows white on light grey. Reported pre-3.0.0 \u2014 reproduce first (new chat, backticks + space to open the fence, type; note the low-contrast combinations), then locate the color source and fix.**\n`#bug`\n`TODO.md:L1319`",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 280,
